Adversarial multi-lens validation surfaced 4 minor F1-introduced issues, all
fixed in the .app-shell adaptation block / AppShell (LOCKED verbatim region
untouched):
- min-height:100vh fallback before 100dvh (old WebView self-heal)
- :focus-visible accent ring on nav tabs + Sell FAB (dark-theme keyboard a11y)
- .app-content horizontal gutter for transitional pages (v5 screens self-pad)
- .spacer-nav tracks env(safe-area-inset-bottom) so content clears the fixed nav

All CI gates green: astro check, build, 159 tests, acceptance, smoke, audit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../2026-06-16-f1-design-system/decisions.md  | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/components/AppShell.astro                 |  4 +++-
 src/styles/global.css                         |  7 +++++++
 3 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/docs/work/2026-06-16-f1-design-system/decisions.md b/docs/work/2026-06-16-f1-design-system/decisions.md
index 241cb84..0a19c4f 100644
--- a/docs/work/2026-06-16-f1-design-system/decisions.md
+++ b/docs/work/2026-06-16-f1-design-system/decisions.md
@@ -63,3 +63,23 @@
 ### Decision gate count: 2 (1 PROCEED, 1 BLOCKED). Plan-quality note: the BLOCKED gate is
 the design.md D7 forward-links decision colliding with a pre-existing first-slice guard that
 planning didn't reconcile — worth catching earlier next time.
+
+---
+
+## /validate (2026-06-16)
+
+All CI gates reproduced locally + green: type-check, convex tsc, build (15 routes),
+route-coverage, 159 tests, acceptance, buyer/seller smoke, `bun audit` (no vulnerabilities).
+
+Adversarial multi-lens review (6 lenses × verify, 16 agents) → 7 confirmed real, 4
+F1-actionable (all minor, all fixed in the adaptation block / AppShell — LOCK untouched):
+1. `.app-shell` `100dvh` → added `100vh` fallback (iOS <15.4 / Chromium <108 self-heal).
+2. Keyboard a11y → added `:focus-visible` accent ring on `.app-shell a` (nav tabs + FAB).
+3. Edge-to-edge regression → restored a content gutter via `.app-content` (transitional
+   pages only; v5 screens with `hideHeader` self-pad).
+4. `.spacer-nav` vs notch → `height:calc(124px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))` so the
+   clearance tracks the fixed nav's safe-area padding.
+
+Deferred (not F1-actionable): `--faint` contrast on `--bg` (inside the LOCKED verbatim
+palette), `color-mix` two-layer-shorthand robustness (moot — the locked design already
+depends on color-mix/oklch broadly), and a docs-only focus-state nit.
diff --git a/src/components/AppShell.astro b/src/components/AppShell.astro
index 516c678..67fe8fe 100644
--- a/src/components/AppShell.astro
+++ b/src/components/AppShell.astro
@@ -36,7 +36,9 @@ const { tab, accent, showFab } = resolveNav(routeId);
         </header>
       )
     }
-    <slot />
+    <div class:list={[{ "app-content": !hideHeader }]}>
+      <slot />
+    </div>
     <div class="spacer-nav"></div>
     <BottomNav tab={tab} showFab={showFab} />
   </div>
diff --git a/src/styles/global.css b/src/styles/global.css
index 776503f..e0f3404 100644
--- a/src/styles/global.css
+++ b/src/styles/global.css
@@ -523,6 +523,7 @@
    switch from position:absolute (inside the phone) to position:fixed (viewport),
    honoring the notch via env(safe-area-inset-bottom). --acc is set per route. */
 .app-shell{
+  min-height:100vh; /* fallback for WebKit <15.4 / Chromium <108 (no dvh) */
   min-height:100dvh;
   background:
     radial-gradient(420px 260px at 50% -6%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--acc, var(--violet)) 9%, transparent), transparent 70%),
@@ -532,3 +533,9 @@
 }
 .app-shell .bnav{position:fixed;padding-bottom:calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
 .app-shell .fab{position:fixed;bottom:calc(88px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
+/* keep the nav clearance in lockstep with the fixed nav's safe-area padding */
+.app-shell .spacer-nav{height:calc(124px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
+/* horizontal gutter for transitional (non-v5) screens; v5 screens self-pad */
+.app-shell .app-content{padding-inline:20px}
+/* visible keyboard focus ring on chrome, keyed to the per-route accent */
+.app-shell a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--acc, var(--violet));outline-offset:2px;border-radius:12px}
